WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.254
- Hey, have you seen Patrick around?

00:00:02.254 --> 00:00:03.871
- Which one is Patrick again?

00:00:03.871 --> 00:00:07.188
- He's the one, he's got
like a big head, just big.

00:00:07.188 --> 00:00:08.704
- Oh yeah, he's in the back.

00:00:08.704 --> 00:00:10.310
He's trying to get a hat on his head.

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:11.779
It's not going really well.

00:00:11.779 --> 00:00:13.381
- His head is big, isn't it?

00:00:13.381 --> 00:00:14.980
- [Voiceover] These are
problems that only people

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:17.272
with big heads will understand.

00:00:17.272 --> 00:00:19.687
There's a few different
types of big heads.

00:00:19.687 --> 00:00:21.524
There's people with round big heads.

00:00:21.524 --> 00:00:24.039
There's people with
optical illusion big heads,

00:00:24.039 --> 00:00:26.056
where up front, it looks normal

00:00:26.056 --> 00:00:28.520
but then they turn to
the side and oh my God.

00:00:29.166 --> 00:00:30.503
Who saw that coming?

00:00:30.503 --> 00:00:31.773
You realize that things were only made

00:00:31.773 --> 00:00:34.674
for people with normal-sized
heads, like helmets.

00:00:34.674 --> 00:00:36.326
(grunts)

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.113
- Ooh here, try these on.

00:00:41.319 --> 00:00:43.450
- [Voiceover] And sunglasses.

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:44.616
Hats are the devil.

00:00:44.616 --> 00:00:45.933
Anyone with a big head can tell you

00:00:45.933 --> 00:00:47.181
that wearing a hat makes you feel

00:00:47.181 --> 00:00:48.746
like you're wearing a yarmulke.

00:00:48.746 --> 00:00:49.735
Fitted hats are terrible.

00:00:49.735 --> 00:00:51.532
Snap-backs are by far, the worst.

00:00:51.532 --> 00:00:53.399
Having one snap is the most embarrassing

00:00:53.399 --> 00:00:55.583
thing about wearing this hat.

00:00:55.583 --> 00:00:56.698
All the other kids look great,

00:00:56.698 --> 00:01:00.239
but your mom had to attach
extra holes so it would fit.

00:01:00.239 --> 00:01:02.532
And it wasn't even the matching color.

00:01:02.532 --> 00:01:04.743
And people with normal
sized heads don't get it.

00:01:04.743 --> 00:01:05.918
- Try this on.

00:01:05.918 --> 00:01:07.583
- No, no, no.
- Come on, try this on.

00:01:07.583 --> 00:01:08.681
- I don't look good in hats.

00:01:08.681 --> 00:01:09.943
- The color is great, come on.

00:01:09.943 --> 00:01:12.506
- No, I don't wanna wear a hat!

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:15.215
"Oh, ha ha, Pat's got a big 'ol head.

00:01:15.215 --> 00:01:16.401
"Put him in a hat."

00:01:16.401 --> 00:01:18.501
Not funny, it's not funny!

00:01:19.533 --> 00:01:20.864
Sorry, I'm sorry.

00:01:20.864 --> 00:01:21.916
- [Voiceover] The one thing that does make

00:01:21.916 --> 00:01:23.452
people with big heads feel better

00:01:23.452 --> 00:01:26.034
is the fact that famous
people have big heads.

00:01:26.034 --> 00:01:26.989
Like Jay Leno.

00:01:26.989 --> 00:01:27.943
Alec Baldwin.

00:01:27.959 --> 00:01:28.845
Idris Elba.

00:01:28.845 --> 00:01:29.977
Angelina Jolie.

00:01:29.977 --> 00:01:31.196
Tyra Banks.

00:01:31.196 --> 00:01:32.276
Rihanna.

00:01:32.276 --> 00:01:34.045
And Nicholas Cage.

00:01:34.045 --> 00:01:36.780
So the fact that those
people went through this

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:39.098
means that there's hope for all of us.

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:40.479
Hang in there, big head.

00:01:40.479 --> 00:01:43.242
(whimsical music)

00:01:43.243 --> 00:01:45.405
(grunts)

